      "content": "ok that makes sense. i'll check my tables for the E and I values. one more thing though—since this is a natural timber build, i'm a bit worried about any internal knots or hidden defects in the wood that might mess with the load capacity. is there a way to account for those potential weak spots in the math so the structure stays safe?",
